This repository contains a machine translation (via
https://github.com/goccy/wasmify and https://github.com/goccy/wasm2go) of the
Perl 5 interpreter compiled to WebAssembly, and is therefore a derivative work
of Perl 5 (https://github.com/Perl/perl5).

